<title>SPAIN: Telefonica cuts mobile charges from Dec 1.</title>
<headline>Telefonica cuts mobile charges from Dec 1.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telefonica Moviles, the mobile phone unit of Spains Telefonica, is to cut charges by up to five pesetas per minute at peak times from December 1, the firm said in a note late on Wednesday.</p>
<p>For &quot;personal&quot; contracts, the charge per minute during the normal timetable will fall 6.25 percent.</p>
<p>For &quot;general&quot; contracts, the charge per minute will fall eleven percent, the note said.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
